* Simplified LM358 behavioral model (single supply), for design checks only
* GBW ~1 MHz, slew ~0.5 V/us, Aol ~100 dB, output swing ~0.02 V .. Vcc-1.5 V, Rout 20 ohm, Isc ~30 mA
.subckt LM358 inp inn vcc vee out
Bgm 0 n1 I = 0.5m*tanh((V(inp)-V(inn))*6.283m/0.5m)
C1 n1 0 1n
R1 n1 0 16meg
Blim n2 0 V = min(max(V(n1), V(vee)+0.02), V(vcc)-1.5)
Bout out 0 I = -max(min((V(n2)-V(out))/20, 30m), -30m)
.ends
